Add breakpoint -> continue to get until the breakpoint
===
First, you need to have an appropriate kernel configuration. I typically set:

CONFIG_MAGIC_SYSRQ=y
CONFIG_MAGIC_SYSRQ_DEFAULT_ENABLE=0x1
CONFIG_MAGIC_SYSRQ_SERIAL=y
CONFIG_MAGIC_SYSRQ_SERIAL_SEQUENCE="g"

Setting CONFIG_MAGIC_SYSRQ_DEFAULT_ENABLE=0x1 enables all sysrq codes; setting CONFIG_MAGIC_SYSRQ_SERIAL_SEQUENCE="g" means that in order to break to the debugger we need to send <break>g.
